WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
[VIOLIN MUSIC]

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:05.840
[SPEAKING ROMANIAN]

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.114
I, uh--

00:00:07.114 --> 00:00:08.450
You don't speak Romanian?

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:12.550
[VIOLIN PLAYING]

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.060
WOMAN: You don't like?
- No.

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:15.681
It's lovely.

00:00:18.058 --> 00:00:22.000
[LAUGHS] There's this guy
that lives across the street,

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.425
and he's always
looking over here.

00:00:23.425 --> 00:00:25.720
Looking over here how?

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:27.520
WOMAN: Every time
I look over there,

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:31.255
he's just staring right at me.

00:00:31.255 --> 00:00:34.105
[WIND HOWLING]

00:00:34.105 --> 00:00:35.060
[SWITCH CLICKS]

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:36.470
MAN: Hello, darling.

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.600
Any reason in particular
you're standing in the dark?

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:41.480
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.560
Do you feel like
coming in for a drink?

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.460
Yeah.

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:46.425
Have you noticed anyone
watching you in your apartment?

00:00:46.425 --> 00:00:48.220
No.

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:53.160
This guy has been watching
us since we moved in.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.205
Maybe he's staring at the
woman who's staring at him.

00:00:56.205 --> 00:00:59.400
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:03.320
[CHAIR CREAKS]

00:01:06.260 --> 00:01:08.220
[CHAIR CREAKS]

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:10.670
[EXHALES]

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:14.590
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.160
WOMAN: What's happening?

00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:19.043
[SIREN WAILS]

00:01:19.043 --> 00:01:20.210
MAN (VOICEOVER):
They found a woman

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.275
murdered in her apartment.

00:01:21.275 --> 00:01:24.230
They're saying the woman
had her head cut off.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.660
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:01:26.660 --> 00:01:28.700
The man at the movie
theater followed me

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.710
into the supermarket.

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:30.920
Followed you?

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:31.876
[CHAIR CREAKS]

00:01:31.876 --> 00:01:33.310
WOMAN (VOICEOVER): [GASPS]

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:34.266
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:01:34.266 --> 00:01:35.470
That's him.

00:01:37.378 --> 00:01:38.809
[DOOR CRANKING]

00:01:39.763 --> 00:01:41.530
WOMAN (VOICEOVER): I
need to know for myself

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:42.880
that he's been following me.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:43.744
[CHAIR CREAKS]

00:01:43.744 --> 00:01:45.472
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:48.610
MAN (VOICEOVER): Sometimes
I just look at people.

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:50.350
MAN: Just tell me what
you want me to do.

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:51.958
I want you to believe me!

00:01:53.767 --> 00:01:55.750
MAN (VOICEOVER): Sure,
they can seen me.

00:01:55.750 --> 00:01:56.590
MAN: [SCREAMS]

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:57.910
I heard screaming
from in here.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:01:58.750
OK?
- Did you?

00:01:58.750 --> 00:01:59.810
Just open the door, please!

00:01:59.810 --> 00:02:01.610
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:03.170
MAN (VOICEOVER):
Dreaming of [INAUDIBLE]

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:05.886
pretty girl looking back at me.

00:02:05.886 --> 00:02:06.824
[GASPS]

00:02:06.824 --> 00:02:08.231
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:02:09.639 --> 00:02:12.490
But no one has
really noticed before.

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:16.390
[PANTING]

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:18.490
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC]

00:02:21.190 --> 00:02:24.540
[SOMBER MUSIC]

